  "description": "Four colourful bird seats sit around the Animal Merry-Go-Round, so each child gets a character to ride. It is sized for small children, with a Key User Group of 3 to 6 years, and seats four at a time. Children push off with their feet or have an adult turn the platform, and they quickly learn to hold on and balance as it spins. The round platform is 6'2\" across and the safe play area is a circle of 12'2\" diameter. The multi colour finish makes it a cheerful centre piece for a pre-primary section or a society toddler corner. Galvanised pipes and roto-moulded seats carry our 3-year warranty, and bearings carry 1 year. Ask us for a layout drawing that shows the full circle.",
